orks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369165/screencap/68e79a014c032.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Each Princess gets a few minutes alone in a bedroom with Satou to deepen their bonds.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369166/screencap/68f0ef05a24ee.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Everyone has adapted too well to living in the Library, but when a monster attacks, Granart awakens her magic.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369167/screencap/68fbb45de0f17.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Hime strengthens the bonds between Ring Princesses allowing them to escape the Library and head to the Empire.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369168/screencap/6904dcdc55afa.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Hime learns to use light magic while Nefritis and Granart also train at the Spire. Satou tours the empire.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369169/screencap/690f3f7d65e8f.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Satou breaks into the Mythic Armory, chats with the Emperor, and goes to pick up Hime from the Spire.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369170/screencap/691720c8b5a20.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Satou enters the illusory world of Hime's tower to confront her fears and bring her back from the Abyss.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369171/screencap/691f167cb65b6.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Satou and Hime have sex.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369172/screencap/69286dac773f9.jpg"},{"synopsis":"The group travels to the Great Mountain Wall and prepares to launch an attack against the Abyss King.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369173/screencap/69317c210af65.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Satou's group steels their resolve and invades the Abyss King's castle to begin their final battle.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369174/screencap/693c3233aae00.jpg"},{"synopsis":"Satou and the princesses fight the Abyss King and the forces of the Abyss.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369175/screencap/694402caccc25.jpg"},{"synopsis":"The final battle against the Abyss reaches its ultimate conclusion.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11369176/screencap/694f47f4e961d.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
